# ttr: dialect=b lang=en
Load items as pol.
Load stock as z2.
Keep the rows where shop_code is "S1".
Call that z2.
Join pol optionally with z2 on code is z2.code as j.
Keep the rows where qty is not empty.
Name the result candidates.
Load pol.
Keep only the rows that have a match in candidates on code is candidates.code.
Show the result as matched.
